WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:04.060
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:10.970
Today, I’m going to explain a Chinese Comedy
drama film called “Twa-Tiu-Tiann.”

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:12.260
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:18.009
Watch out and take care!

00:00:18.009 --> 00:00:23.630
Jack Chen Youxi is a 20 year old melancholic
college student from Taipei.

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:30.250
His grandfather moved to Taiwan from Anxi
in Quanzhou, China in the mid-19th century.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.460
At the tender age of 5, Jack lost his mother.

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:38.190
She suffered from chronic depression and one
day overdosed on her pills.

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:43.870
With no mother and his father always busy
with work, Jack feels lost and has no idea

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:45.550
about his future.

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:50.510
Jack has an eccentric history teacher who
everyone dearly calls Professor P. Sometimes,

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:54.190
the history teacher is also called the Professor
Pig.

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:57.940
Jack and his friends often go to his office
for private classes.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:03.970
One day, in one such private class, Jack notices
an ancient camera in the Professor’s room

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:06.979
and uses it to click the picture of a wall
clock.

00:01:06.979 --> 00:01:12.299
However, he suddenly remembers something important
and hands the camera back to the professor,

00:01:12.299 --> 00:01:15.120
abruptly leaving the class with his friends.

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:19.530
The professor is left puzzled by their sudden
departure but he gets even more astonished

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:25.270
when he notices that the wall clock stopped
momentarily after Jack clicked its picture.

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:28.729
Professor P wonders by himself, “is he the
one?”.

00:01:28.729 --> 00:01:33.159
It turns out that Jack was rushing to wish
his girlfriend a happy birthday but she breaks

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:34.369
up with him instead.

00:01:34.369 --> 00:01:39.189
She tells him that he doesn’t know what
“true love” is after he gives her a teddy

00:01:39.189 --> 00:01:42.830
bear, forgetting that she is allergic to soft
toys.

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:48.729
The next day, Jack goes to the Twa tiu tiann
museum with his class accompanied by Professor

00:01:48.729 --> 00:01:55.389
P. Twa tiu tiann was the most prosperous area
in Taiwan during the Japanese occupation in

00:01:55.389 --> 00:01:56.389
the 1920s.

00:01:56.389 --> 00:02:02.130
The museum has a vast collection of relics
from that time such as the water dungeon where

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:06.280
Taiwan’s founding father Dr. Chiang was
imprisoned by the Japanese.

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:11.280
Jack notices the phrase “the flower of youth
is…” carved on the dungeon.

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:16.610
By the Water dungeon, a man gives Jack and
his friends a commemorative coin with Dr.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:17.830
Chiang’s portrait.

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:22.220
Jack continues to wander around the museum
and comes across the iconic “South Street

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:25.000
Festival” painting of the TTT.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:30.170
Seeing Jack checking out the painting, Professor
P hands him the same old camera and asks him

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:31.580
to take its picture.

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:37.850
Jack obliges and lo and behold, time freezes
again and the painting comes to life.

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:42.110
Just as Jack begins to wrap his head around
it, he gets sucked into the painting and sent

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:44.150
to 1922 Taiwan.

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:50.050
There, he runs into his friend ‘Black cat’
and his younger brother but they do not recognise

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:51.050
him.

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:55.360
The brothers drag Jack with them to participate
in a cultural procession where he gets into

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:58.790
trouble with a textile businessman named Mr.
Lin.

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:04.040
However, a woman named Ms Ginger, who looks
just like Jack’s mother, saves him.

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:08.900
Ginger also owns a clothing business and is
an arch rival of Mr. Lin.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:13.040
Jack is stunned to see his mother but she
too doesn’t recognise him.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:18.220
Puzzled and overwhelmed, Jack passes out from
shock and wakes up the next day in Ms. Ginger’s

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:19.220
home.

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:23.140
He ventures out into the street with Black
cat and his friends to try and understand

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.140
what’s going on.

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:29.400
At the market, he and his new mates are threatened
by the businessman’s son Wenshow.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:34.850
Later, Jack learns that a man named Master
Pig, who looks just like Professor P, works

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:37.030
as a tailor for Ms. Ginger.

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:41.580
Angry at Professor P for sending him inside
the painting, Jack gets into a quarrel with

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.870
Master Pig, who denies knowing him.

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:47.360
The commotion attracts the attention of the
Japanese colonial police.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:51.980
Ms. Ginger again comes to their rescue and
takes the Japanese officers away.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:57.010
Master Pig then finally comes clean about
his identity and role in bringing Jack here.

00:03:57.010 --> 00:04:00.940
The Professor takes Jack to his theatre and
promises to tell him the reason he brought

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:03.150
him here when the right time comes.

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:09.200
It turns out Master Pig is Professor P afterall
and he not only works as tailor but as a play

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.000
director as well.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:16.130
Jack notices a beautiful girl named Rose in
the audience and instantly falls for her.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:21.640
Rose and her friends are Geisha i.e., girls
that are trained to entertain men with conversation,

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:23.040
dance and song.

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:27.520
To impress Rose, Jack takes on the role of
a tree and the play begins.

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:32.170
He turns the romantic tragedy into a comedy
just to make her laugh, making spectators

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:33.980
laugh till their stomach hurts.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:37.920
The play is suddenly interrupted when Japanese
officers come barging in.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:42.650
The Japanese officer reveals that the crown
prince of Japan will be visiting Taiwan in

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:47.750
the coming week and hence, all non-japanese
entertainment will be banned until after his

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:48.750
visit.

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:52.740
However, the Professor and others resist the
Japanese hegemony.

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:58.010
Rose stands up and starts singing a taiwanese
song in defiance of the Japanese occupation,

00:04:58.010 --> 00:04:59.740
soon followed by others.

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:04.450
Unable to stop or control the entire crowd,
the Japanese officers leave with their tails

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:05.930
between their legs.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:11.210
Later, Jack finds a drawing of the present
day Taiwan and attempts to go back but without

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:12.210
success.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:16.330
The Professor tells the dork that the picture
is incomplete and hence can’t function as

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:17.640
a time portal.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:21.730
Moreover, one must make a wish with all their
heart to teleport.

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:26.340
It is also revealed that the Professor came
to the Twa tiu tiann with a dream of becoming

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:27.340
rich.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.880
Here, he met Ginger and fell in love.

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:35.330
Ever since then he has been going in and out
of the TTT to earn a lot of money and win

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:37.120
over Ginger’s heart.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:42.130
Professor proposes a deal to Jack, asking
his help to keep other suitors away from Ginger

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:44.790
in return for getting the painting complete.

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:47.290
Jack agrees.

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:50.840
The Professor continues to court Ginger but
without success.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:54.470
Meanwhile, Jack becomes close with the Professor's
theatre actors.

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:59.310
He helps them create melodies and new looks
for their play with his knowledge of the 21st

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:00.310
century.

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:05.030
One day, Rose comes to a neighbouring store
where multiple suitors including Wenshow are

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:07.020
trying their luck with Rose.

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:12.180
Jack also rushes there with his guitar and
serenades her with the Happy Birthday song.

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:16.190
Mesmerized by him, Rose formally introduces
herself to him.

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:20.110
Just as they get to know each other, they
are suddenly interrupted by a speech being

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:26.230
delivered by Dr. Chiang Wei-Shui, Taiwanese
doctor and freedom fighter, outside the store.

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:32.040
In his electrifying speech, Dr. Chiang calls
out Japanese occupation and the opium cultivation

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.740
imposed on Taiwanese.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:39.060
The Japanese officers soon start to disperse
the crowd, forcing Jack and Black Cat to hide

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:40.199
in a shop.

00:06:40.199 --> 00:06:44.950
Mr. Lin coincidentally brings his son to the
same shop and scolds him for listening to

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:50.530
Dr. Chiang’s speech, jeopardizing Mr. Lin’s
covert business relations with the Japanese.

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:55.080
Mr. Lin reminds Wenshow that their fabric
business is doing well because of Japanese

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.130
support and investment.

00:06:57.130 --> 00:07:00.860
Jack and Black Cat overhear the whole conversation.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:04.690
Over the course of the next few days, Jack
and his theatre friends get busy preparing

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:09.700
the Geisha girls for the governor’s party,
where all local VIPs are to be invited.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:14.310
Jack tells Rose that he came from the future
and about the end of Japanese occupation while

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:18.030
she tells him her wish to one day become a
professional singer.

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:27.480
At the party, Dr. Chiang again clashes with
the Japanese officials but before things could

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:31.520
escalate, Rose defuses the situation with
her charming performance.

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:36.110
Later, Jack steals Rose away and wanders around
the governor’s mansion.

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:39.520
When a group of guards pass by, they hide
in a water dungeon.

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:44.440
At that moment, Jack tells Rose that in the
future everything becomes so easy that people

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:47.699
get lost and forget about their youth and
dreams.

00:07:47.699 --> 00:07:53.250
Inspired by Jack’s words, Rose carves “The
flower of youth is…” on the dungeon before

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:54.449
kissing him.

00:07:54.449 --> 00:08:00.190
Jack finally realises what true love is.

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:04.390
While returning home, Jack notices Ginger
sneaking out of the house at night to go to

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:05.750
an opium club.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:10.970
When he reaches the club, Jack finds Ginger
stoned out of her mind with Professor P by

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:11.970
her side.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:16.820
Reminded of his late drug-addict mother, Jack
scolds the Professor for enabling Ginger and

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:17.990
takes her home.

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:22.780
After coming to her senses, Ginger reveals
that she lost her husband and son to Cholera

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:24.070
ten years ago.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:29.449
She uses the “high” to momentarily escape
the unbearable pain of losing her child.

00:08:29.449 --> 00:08:33.440
Jack figures out that the Professor needs
money to help Ginger buy opium and relieve

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:34.440
her pain.

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:38.380
Ginger admits that she likes the Professor
but can’t commit to him because he keeps

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:41.729
disappearing as if he doesn’t belong in
this world.

00:08:41.729 --> 00:08:46.529
It is then revealed the Japanese colonial
propaganda had Taiwanese people convinced

00:08:46.529 --> 00:08:49.950
that an addict quitting opium could lead to
their death.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:54.930
Jack vows to help Ginger and other Taiwanese
who have become victims of opium and begins

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:58.700
a fierce awareness campaign with the help
of Dr. Chiang.

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:02.120
Jack also makes the Professor burn down the
local opium house.

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:06.820
However, this puts Dr. Chiang and Professor
P on the Japanese hit list.

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:11.110
The Japanese officers arrive at Ginger’s
home to arrest the Professor.

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:17.640
However, Mr. Lin interferes and for the first
time, he speaks out against the Japanese occupation.

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:19.660
A chaos ensues.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:24.000
The Japanese officer accidentally fires his
gun, fatally wounding Ginger.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:28.550
The Japanese officer orders all hospitals
to not admit patients with gunshot wounds

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:31.330
before heading to arrest Dr. Chiang.

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:35.490
Left with no choice, Jack takes Ginger back
to the theatre, deciding to take her to the

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:37.490
future for treatment.

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:41.510
After everyone leaves, Wenshow notices that
the bullet also hit his father.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:47.280
Dr. Chiang arrives but by then it is too late
and Mr. Lin dies in his son’s arms.

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:52.420
At the theatre, Jack asks the Professor to
take Ginger to the future while he decides

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:53.430
to stay.

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:56.410
Jack has finally realised his purpose in life.

00:09:56.410 --> 00:10:00.560
Chiang is arrested for treason while the working
class Tiawanese are barred from appearing

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:05.270
in public during his majesty prince Hirohito's
impending visit.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:10.600
Wenshow and his friends join forces with Jack’s
group and plot to free Dr. Chiang.

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:16.000
One night, the Geisha girls distract the guards
and Jack and the boys free Dr. Chiang from

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.710
the infamous water dungeon.

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:22.860
Meanwhile, the local Taiwanese opium trader
whose business is being threatened by Dr.

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:28.200
Chiang’s anti-opium campaign, hires Korean
assassins to assassinate the Japanese prince

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:29.380
to frame the doctor.

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:33.480
Dr. Chiang catches wind of the plot and vows
to protect the prince.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:37.830
Jack and his friends spread rumours around
town that those who don’t attend Prince

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:43.060
Hirohito’s arrival ceremony will get cursed,
hoping to attract a large crowd to make things

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:48.880
difficult for the assassins.

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:53.680
By the time Prince Hirohito arrives, Professor
P also returns from the future.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:57.940
As the prince heads towards Ginger’s shop,
Jack and Professor P notice the assassins

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:00.930
on the roof, gearing to shoot the prince.

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:05.170
While the Professor hurls the painting towards
the bullet, Jack and Rose throw themselves

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:07.370
at the bullet, hoping to stop it.

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:13.550
However, before anyone has to die, the Professor
clicks a picture of Jack, Rose and the bullet

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:17.420
with the painting, teleporting all of them
to present day Taiwan.

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:24.600
Meanwhile in 1923 Taiwan, Dr. Chiang and other
Tiawanese chant slogans of freedom and equality

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:26.790
in front of Prince Hirohito’s procession.

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:31.720
Dr. Chiang becomes the first Taiwanese to
be arrested for petitioning for freedom and

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:35.530
the colonial government begins hunting down
anyone involved.

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:37.810
Professor P returns to present day Taiwan.

00:11:37.810 --> 00:11:42.510
As he proceeds to send Rose and Jack back
to the past, Jack turns to Rose and tells

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:44.450
her his decision to stay.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:48.580
He tells her that he wanted to go with her
but he likes the way he was before.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:51.500
Brave and Reckless.

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:56.860
Moreover, the 1920s are her golden days not
his.

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:00.190
He wants to stay back to create his own golden
days.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:02.660
He wants to tell his people about their history.

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:07.320
Jack then kisses Rose before tearfully parting
ways.

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:11.160
Ginger arrives and Jack embraces her with
tears of joy.

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:16.080
To Professor P’s joy, Ginger then reveals
her decision to stay with him in the present.

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:21.750
Jack wanders inside the TTT museum by himself
and looks at the writings on the water dungeon

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:27.120
that, now, says, “The flower of youth is
the blooming rose” while holding his tears

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:28.120
back.

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:31.920
Jack had completed Rose’s sentence when
he was with her in the past.

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:36.770
All the blissful time he spent with Rose flashes
before his eyes and Jack eventually breaks

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:37.990
into tears.

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:43.430
Later, Jack goes to meet his friends and embraces
them like never before.

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:47.580
They sit by the water and talk about their
aspirations.

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:54.170
The movie then ends with Jack noticing and
smiling at a girl who looks just like a blooming

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:55.260
Rose.

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:59.640
